  "description": "多平台多语言编码增强套件。9 Agent + 13 Skill + 15 Command + 8 Rules + Ralph 自主循环。支持 TS/Python/Rust/Go/Java/C#/Ruby/PHP/Swift/Kotlin，兼容 Claude Code/OpenCode/OpenClaw/Hermes。",
